Update v1.1 (23-09-95).
=======================

* Major update! Now full MAILMANAGER SUPPORT!
  - Check's for MailManager config, and shows the area's to choose from
    in ALFABETIC listings (Wich MM does not!).
  - Program will now wirk with Fhatch or MailManager (see .cfg file!).

* Unlimited area's added!
  - Now you can browse thrue pages with (N)ext and (P)revious.
    This way there's no max. area limit anymore.

* Warphatch can now be started anywhere.
  - So place the "#0Pfiles:warphatch/warphatch.rexx}" command in BBSMENU
    wherever you want to run it.

* Information window added.
  - When using MailManager, you can get a full screen information window
    about an Tick-area when you hit the (I)nformation key.

* New @Mailware@ keyfile needed! so ask The Duke if you need one.

* More check's added for existence of MM and Files.

* Changed routine for getting the Filenotes.
  - Cnet description fuck'd up many times, so Filenote used instead.

* Added extra flag in wARPhatch.cfg !!! check it out!
 

